  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Yi Tian Mountain, while Southern Border rank eight Gu Immortals try to break the ten extreme immortal zombie lifeless formation, a black-robed formation member blocks them and is named Carefree Wisdom Heart Physique, another immortal zombie of the ten extreme physiques. Peng Shi Long recognizes the holder as Shang clan’s Shang Gui Cai. The black-robed immortal zombie answers that Shang Gui Cai is only an identity used after soul replacement. The four immortals then list Blazing Glory Lightning Brilliance, Northern Dark Ice Soul, and Carefree Wisdom Heart among ten extreme physiques appearing one after another, and judge the formation uses those physiques for its power.",
      "chapters": [
        969
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
