      "mentions": [
        "sys_ten_extreme_physique"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fairy Ming Hao fights Fang Yuan’s subordinates at the black and white Sacred Mountain in Green Lotus Great World, Lu Wei Yin blocks a starlight attack and asks “Carefree Wisdom Heart?” with peculiarity.",
      "chapters": [
        2159
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lu-wei-yin-question",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_ming_hao",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_black_and_white_sacred_mountain",
        "loc_green_lotus_great_world",
        "char_lu_wei_yin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After reviewing the same fight, Lu Wei Yin states that Fairy Ming Hao possesses the Carefree Wisdom Heart Physique and also has humility Gu and pride Gu, which reminds him of the description in The Legends of Ren Zu. He also says he knows of no such person in Heavenly Court history, and that she seems to have a deep connection with Star Constellation Immortal Venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        2160
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "holder-identified",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_humility_gu",
        "gu_pride_gu",
        "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Shang clan’s competition records credit Shang Gui Cai with the best result in Shang clan history, one million one hundred and ten thousand. Wei Yang calls his talent monstrous but his fate unfortunate for being one of the ten extreme physiques.",
      "chapters": [
        322
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shang-gui-cais-record",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wei_yang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The sources disagree on where Carefree Wisdom Heart falls among Ren Zu’s children.",
